WEBVTT

00:00:00.970 --> 00:00:02.970
Looks like I dragged you with me.

00:00:02.970 --> 00:00:06.420
It's fine. I got to see something nice.

00:00:06.420 --> 00:00:07.180
Something nice?

00:00:07.440 --> 00:00:09.800
Saint Germain, you're smiling.

00:00:10.220 --> 00:00:15.280
Yeah. How long has it been 
since I haven't wanted to die?

00:00:22.290 --> 00:00:24.470
Right, mom?

00:00:35.040 --> 00:00:39.390
Alchemists... Seekers of ideals...

00:00:39.390 --> 00:00:42.370
Now we just need to deal 
with the divine energy...

00:00:43.360 --> 00:00:47.290
I need to thank you.

00:00:49.140 --> 00:00:51.410
Adam Weishaupt!

00:00:51.410 --> 00:00:53.110
You're still after the power of the gods?

00:00:53.110 --> 00:00:57.090
This time... it's in my hand!

00:01:04.620 --> 00:01:06.590
But even if that's true...

00:01:06.910 --> 00:01:09.290
I won't let you near it.

00:01:09.290 --> 00:01:11.000
Adam, you meanie!

00:01:11.250 --> 00:01:14.710
You won't hug me, so I'll hug you!

00:01:15.710 --> 00:01:16.800
Don't!

00:01:16.800 --> 00:01:19.420
That isn't just the ever-so-helpful 
power of a god-killer!

00:01:20.220 --> 00:01:23.660
A philosophical weapon filled 
with 2,000 years of curses!

00:01:23.660 --> 00:01:26.680
If you use it, the curse will fall upon you!

00:01:26.680 --> 00:01:30.570
I'll punch you with my song!

00:01:50.400 --> 00:01:54.440
<i>Saint Germain-san's song reached my heart.</i>

00:01:54.440 --> 00:01:57.660
<i>But there was nothing I could do!</i>

00:01:58.140 --> 00:01:59.650
Once again...

00:02:00.680 --> 00:02:03.270
all I could do was punch!

00:02:03.470 --> 00:02:06.980
<b>Episode 13
The Reality Proved When Each Tear Falls On The Next</b>

00:02:07.860 --> 00:02:11.300
No sign of fallout or EMP.

00:02:11.910 --> 00:02:15.770
The power of the Lapis Philosophicus, 
which banishes all impurities...

00:02:16.150 --> 00:02:20.670
She used not just her Faust Robe but her 
very life as a vessel for the Philosopher's Stone

00:02:20.670 --> 00:02:22.690
to avert the damage from 
the reactive weapons...

00:02:23.250 --> 00:02:25.380
But the price she paid...

00:02:25.680 --> 00:02:26.620
Yes.

00:02:26.620 --> 00:02:31.050
What protected this country was 
alchemists dying for their ideals.

00:02:33.490 --> 00:02:36.540
Thank you, Saint Germain-san.

00:02:36.940 --> 00:02:40.610
But this isn't the ending I wanted.

00:02:41.010 --> 00:02:42.960
I wanted to talk to you more!

00:02:42.960 --> 00:02:45.010
I wanted us to understand each other!

00:02:45.350 --> 00:02:47.970
You wanted to understand each other?

00:02:47.970 --> 00:02:53.090
I want... I want to hug each other...

00:02:53.090 --> 00:02:54.630
Adam...

00:02:54.630 --> 00:02:56.060
I love—

00:02:57.350 --> 00:03:01.620
Understanding each other is impossible as 
long as the Curse of Balal is in effect.

00:03:02.200 --> 00:03:07.080
Until we can surpass the custodians that 
laid the curse on us, the Anunnaki.

00:03:07.670 --> 00:03:09.240
Even if that's true...

00:03:09.500 --> 00:03:12.640
But if we become one, that changes.

00:03:12.640 --> 00:03:17.760
With a ruler, the disordered masses
 will achieve a perfect form.

00:03:17.760 --> 00:03:19.190
Even if that's true!

00:03:21.410 --> 00:03:24.820
The fact that we kept reaching out
 to understand one another...

00:03:24.820 --> 00:03:26.620
...wasn't meaningless!

00:03:27.370 --> 00:03:30.200
Yes. The dummy's right!

00:03:30.610 --> 00:03:34.180
Just like you said, we're not that smart.

00:03:34.180 --> 00:03:39.540
That's why we keep rising up again 
and again, like stupid people do!

00:03:39.540 --> 00:03:42.510
No matter how many times it 
takes, without giving up!

00:03:42.510 --> 00:03:46.680
We've repeated that, 
taking one step forward at a time!

00:03:46.900 --> 00:03:49.200
So just because you think you're perfect,

00:03:49.700 --> 00:03:54.990
don't think you can rule 
over us imperfect beings!

00:03:55.420 --> 00:03:59.010
How can you talk so big?

00:03:59.010 --> 00:04:00.880
How can you be so proud?

00:04:07.390 --> 00:04:09.840
Someone who's inhuman 
would never understand!

00:04:10.280 --> 00:04:15.310
<i>A love that never loses 
is within my fists (bloom)</i>

00:04:15.310 --> 00:04:20.850
<i>A beautiful blade, wings 
dancing in the moonlight</i>

00:04:19.610 --> 00:04:20.860
<b>Wind Circle Fire Slash Moon Shine</b>

00:04:20.850 --> 00:04:25.840
<i>GUN BULLET X-Kiss becoming 
power (I'll show no mercy)</i>

00:04:25.840 --> 00:04:30.870
<i>Stand up, ready, show it,
 head for the heavens</i>

00:04:30.870 --> 00:04:33.880
<i>Connect your melody to tomorrow</i>

00:04:33.880 --> 00:04:38.370
<i>Become sunshine and bring your bonds together</i>

00:04:38.370 --> 00:04:46.510
<i>Never give up, from fighting,
 this heart, this life</i>

00:04:39.330 --> 00:04:42.600
Why does conflict never end?

00:04:42.600 --> 00:04:46.520
Conflict is always a collision of beliefs...

00:04:46.510 --> 00:04:49.620
<i>Resonate, resonate, resonate together</i>

00:04:46.520 --> 00:04:50.520
Are you saying that choosing 
justice is the cause of conflict?

00:04:49.620 --> 00:04:54.420
<i>Put everything into your 
songs and create a story</i>

00:04:50.520 --> 00:04:54.580
I don't want to stop going forward 
for the sake of a simple answer!

00:04:54.420 --> 00:05:01.880
<i>For the future, for your dreams,
 hold your resolve high</i>

00:05:01.060 --> 00:05:04.400
The unison of the six Wielders is
 causing the phonic gain to climb!

00:05:04.400 --> 00:05:08.780
But we're nowhere near being able 
to activate the Ex-Drive...

00:05:10.990 --> 00:05:14.800
It's all the fault of the Curse of Balal, 
which prevents mutual understanding!

00:05:16.730 --> 00:05:22.510
<i>Passionate song, lift up your melody</i>

00:05:23.580 --> 00:05:24.790
But even if that's true!

00:05:25.790 --> 00:05:28.330
You're not going to use the Ex-Drive?

00:05:28.660 --> 00:05:30.500
No, you can't, can you?

00:05:30.500 --> 00:05:35.600
There's not enough phonic gain here for 
you to be able to wield a miracle!

00:05:31.010 --> 00:05:40.260
<i>Never give up, from fighting, 
this heart, this life</i>

00:05:37.930 --> 00:05:39.660
Don't get cocky!

00:05:40.260 --> 00:05:42.780
<i>Resonate, resonate, resonate together</i>

00:05:42.780 --> 00:05:47.890
<i>Put everything into your 
songs and create a story</i>

00:05:44.660 --> 00:05:46.650
With his power lost...

00:05:47.890 --> 00:05:53.370
<i>For the future, for your dreams,
 hold your resolve high</i>

00:05:53.370 --> 00:05:57.880
<i>That songs will never die!</i>

00:06:00.280 --> 00:06:02.570
It reached him... but...

00:06:02.830 --> 00:06:05.540
Yeah. The enemy is the Controlling Director.

00:06:05.920 --> 00:06:07.800
Adam Weishaupt!

00:06:10.090 --> 00:06:11.260
The left arm?

00:06:15.190 --> 00:06:16.610
That's right.

00:06:16.610 --> 00:06:19.640
I've lost my power.

00:06:19.640 --> 00:06:24.450
So I can't maintain...

00:06:24.450 --> 00:06:28.110
my beautiful, perfect form!

00:06:28.440 --> 00:06:30.560
His mass is increasing from within!

00:06:33.830 --> 00:06:36.490
That form... it's like...

00:06:36.920 --> 00:06:40.630
I didn't want it known that I was a doll.

00:06:41.460 --> 00:06:44.970
I didn't want to take this form.

00:06:44.970 --> 00:06:49.100
But I've got no choice but 
to have horns on my head!

00:06:49.100 --> 00:06:51.690
I'm just like you! I can't afford to lose!

00:06:55.290 --> 00:06:58.540
So that's True Adam?

00:07:02.310 --> 00:07:04.970
He was willing to abandon his human form?

00:07:05.440 --> 00:07:07.770
What is he going to do?

00:07:08.380 --> 00:07:12.780
You monkeys were made to be mere 
terminals. You are unworthy.

00:07:13.140 --> 00:07:17.780
I will make you understand that
 I am a more perfect being. A ruler.

00:07:17.780 --> 00:07:23.090
For that, I needed a temporary 
power to stand alongside them.

00:07:34.710 --> 00:07:36.860
He's far faster than he looks!

00:07:38.600 --> 00:07:40.840
What's a phone doing here?

00:07:44.050 --> 00:07:47.150
And he's just as sly and nasty!

00:07:47.150 --> 00:07:48.610
Damn it all!

00:07:49.600 --> 00:07:50.560
How dare you?!

00:07:59.630 --> 00:08:01.530
He's more powerful than us.

00:08:01.970 --> 00:08:04.300
It's not over yet, Tachibana Hibiki!

00:08:12.360 --> 00:08:15.470
What is it you were planning to do,

00:08:16.440 --> 00:08:20.050
Saint Germain, you spellcaster?!

00:08:23.000 --> 00:08:25.850
Using the energy that 
makes up the Faust Robe?!

00:08:25.850 --> 00:08:28.820
It has to be the Ex-Drive!

00:08:28.810 --> 00:08:37.270
<i>Gatrandis babel ziggurat edenal.</i>

00:08:30.720 --> 00:08:31.770
This song...

00:08:37.270 --> 00:08:45.390
<i>Emustolronzen fine el baral zizzl...</i>

00:08:40.660 --> 00:08:43.120
The S2CA Hexa-Conversion!

00:08:43.120 --> 00:08:46.220
If we're going to use a variation...

00:08:45.390 --> 00:08:54.170
<i>Gatrandis babel ziggurat edenal.</i>

00:08:46.220 --> 00:08:48.120
It's worth a try!

00:08:48.620 --> 00:08:49.460
That's crazy!

00:08:49.460 --> 00:08:51.850
That energy doesn't come from phonic gain!

00:08:52.170 --> 00:08:55.810
The Gears might not be able to
 handle it! They could explode!

00:08:56.140 --> 00:08:59.990
I'll connect a bypass and allow the
 Dáinsleif to offload the stress.

00:08:59.990 --> 00:09:02.230
I'll incinerate it as a catalyst!

00:09:02.710 --> 00:09:04.180
But is that possible?

00:09:04.180 --> 00:09:05.650
We'll make it possible!

00:09:05.650 --> 00:09:07.310
That's our job!

00:09:07.870 --> 00:09:10.400
Looks like there's no 
time to talk about it...

00:09:10.820 --> 00:09:20.530
<i>Emustolronzen fine el zizzl.</i>

00:09:16.140 --> 00:09:20.530
HQ has established a backup 
system! Hibiki-san!

00:09:20.530 --> 00:09:25.120
Barrier Coating Release!

00:09:36.500 --> 00:09:38.560
No matter what you do...

00:09:38.890 --> 00:09:40.010
Draw Swords!

00:09:40.360 --> 00:09:42.270
Last Ignition!

00:09:44.020 --> 00:09:46.700
There's no limit to your futile struggles!

00:09:47.720 --> 00:09:50.280
Accept perfection!

00:09:57.530 --> 00:10:00.740
I've made up for my flaws with alchemy...

00:10:01.150 --> 00:10:03.680
to reach perfection someday,

00:10:03.680 --> 00:10:05.190
to surpass it!

00:10:05.190 --> 00:10:07.600
Even if that's true!

00:10:14.170 --> 00:10:17.800
You overstep your place, humanity!

00:10:24.440 --> 00:10:27.640
The Gears are moaning! They're screaming!

00:10:27.640 --> 00:10:29.860
We won't be able to keep this up!

00:10:30.720 --> 00:10:33.300
You increased your output?

00:10:35.470 --> 00:10:36.690
So basically...

00:10:36.980 --> 00:10:40.150
You rebuilt the Symphogears 
at the last second?

00:10:40.150 --> 00:10:43.070
If we finish it now, it's not a problem!

00:10:49.380 --> 00:10:51.760
Even without the Ex-Drive!

00:11:13.720 --> 00:11:15.730
No! Recoil corruption?!

00:11:15.730 --> 00:11:16.930
Now of all times?

00:11:17.360 --> 00:11:21.530
That's right! Hibiki-san's Gear is the
 only one that wasn't cleansed!

00:11:21.530 --> 00:11:22.450
Hibiki!

00:11:24.880 --> 00:11:27.970
It looks as though you can't move, god-killer.

00:11:28.520 --> 00:11:31.950
This is the end of your struggles.

00:11:40.570 --> 00:11:41.800
Reach out your hands!

00:11:44.940 --> 00:11:47.290
This ends now.

00:11:48.400 --> 00:11:49.590
Hibiki!

00:12:03.700 --> 00:12:05.790
Impossible... Is that my...?

00:12:07.440 --> 00:12:10.320
This power... It's everyone's.

00:12:10.320 --> 00:12:14.680
You can't just do whatever you want!

00:12:17.910 --> 00:12:19.610
Then...

00:12:20.800 --> 00:12:22.640
That's my Juliet!

00:12:22.920 --> 00:12:23.930
I'm borrowing this!

00:12:24.750 --> 00:12:26.090
Azure Flash!

00:12:26.090 --> 00:12:29.050
I won't let anyone deny me!

00:12:32.940 --> 00:12:35.150
Everyone's Armed Gears!

00:12:35.150 --> 00:12:36.540
Forbidden Moon Wheel!

00:12:36.540 --> 00:12:38.310
She's using our techniques?

00:12:38.310 --> 00:12:41.500
No, that's another connected power!

00:12:41.770 --> 00:12:44.030
Hibiki-san's Armed Gear!

00:12:44.030 --> 00:12:47.510
I don't have time to be 
doing something like this,

00:12:47.510 --> 00:12:48.740
in a place like this!

00:12:50.860 --> 00:12:54.350
The custodians will descend soon!

00:12:54.350 --> 00:12:56.680
I must have it before they do!

00:12:56.680 --> 00:13:00.980
A power to resist the 
Anunnaki and surpass them!

00:13:00.980 --> 00:13:03.840
But you...

00:13:03.840 --> 00:13:04.750
Blow him away!

00:13:04.750 --> 00:13:05.870
Armor Purge!

00:13:09.850 --> 00:13:12.600
Sorry for pushing you so hard, Gungnir!

00:13:12.600 --> 00:13:13.800
I just need one hit!

00:13:13.800 --> 00:13:16.510
Bring everybody's feelings down on him!

00:13:17.480 --> 00:13:20.060
Time to pay you back!

00:13:20.060 --> 00:13:22.540
With interest! With fees!

00:13:22.540 --> 00:13:26.120
Hear the howl of revolution, 
which cries out against control!

00:13:26.120 --> 00:13:33.200
Balwisyall nescell Gungnir tron!

00:13:40.140 --> 00:13:44.760
A Golden Transmutation?
 From someone who isn't an alchemist?

00:14:30.720 --> 00:14:34.630
Hope was destroyed today!

00:14:34.630 --> 00:14:38.710
Despair for tomorrow! For the future!

00:14:52.760 --> 00:14:57.070
Now Adam... and the 
Illuminati... are finished!

00:14:57.690 --> 00:14:58.760
Yes.

00:14:59.500 --> 00:15:01.390
We've won.

00:15:06.660 --> 00:15:07.730
Here you go.

00:15:08.430 --> 00:15:10.950
It's been three days.

00:15:10.950 --> 00:15:13.360
You're working too hard again, I think.

00:15:13.820 --> 00:15:17.260
You managed to clean out the
 corruption from Hibiki-san's Gear.

00:15:17.260 --> 00:15:19.310
You need to rest a little.

00:15:19.310 --> 00:15:24.610
Thank you. But I need to 
go back over all this...

00:15:24.610 --> 00:15:26.110
Something worries me.

00:15:28.660 --> 00:15:34.870
The power of the gods should only
 be able to dwell in a pure soul...

00:15:35.170 --> 00:15:39.530
It cannot dwell in the body of a 
human born under original sin...

00:15:40.310 --> 00:15:42.730
Then does that mean Hibiki-san is...

00:15:42.730 --> 00:15:45.290
What is original sin, exactly?

00:15:46.340 --> 00:15:49.190
Commander, it's from Ogawa-san in London.

00:15:49.190 --> 00:15:50.460
Put him through.

00:15:51.540 --> 00:15:53.090
What's going on there?

00:15:53.870 --> 00:15:58.720
Our work with the world's 
governments to clear out

00:15:58.720 --> 00:16:02.520
the remaining survivors of the 
Illuminati is proceeding.

00:16:02.520 --> 00:16:05.560
But without the Illuminati protecting them,

00:16:05.560 --> 00:16:10.400
they may go underground and 
be even harder to find.

00:16:11.680 --> 00:16:14.500
<i>We'll continue our work.</i>

00:16:15.180 --> 00:16:20.020
And then there's the threat of 
the custodians, the Anunnaki...

00:16:25.560 --> 00:16:32.330
So the US is using the security treaty 
to justify their use of the missiles?

00:16:32.990 --> 00:16:36.450
The world's governments are 
voicing their objections

00:16:36.450 --> 00:16:38.940
to the US's defiance of the UN's decision.

00:16:38.940 --> 00:16:41.980
But no one can voice their 
concerns too strongly...

00:16:44.800 --> 00:16:52.740
Because they saw the incredible
 power of the gods for themselves...

00:16:53.890 --> 00:16:57.690
Yatsuhiro, if we had that power,

00:16:57.690 --> 00:17:02.680
don't you think we could keep our 
country safe from both foreign enemies

00:17:02.680 --> 00:17:05.050
and the special disasters?

00:17:12.130 --> 00:17:14.060
Okay, once more...

00:17:14.060 --> 00:17:15.970
Happy Birthday!

00:17:15.970 --> 00:17:17.210
Death!

00:17:20.090 --> 00:17:23.140
Happy 17th Birthday, Hibiki!

00:17:23.140 --> 00:17:26.640
Thank you! It was a crazy birthday!

00:17:26.640 --> 00:17:32.470
But I'm really happy I was able to 
celebrate it, thanks to all you!

00:17:32.470 --> 00:17:36.060
Come on, no fancy speeches!

00:17:36.060 --> 00:17:38.500
Come right this way!

00:17:39.700 --> 00:17:41.620
Wow!

00:17:41.620 --> 00:17:43.160
Where did all this come from?

00:17:43.930 --> 00:17:47.160
Shirabe worked really hard.

00:17:47.650 --> 00:17:49.660
Shirabe-chan made this?

00:17:49.660 --> 00:17:52.430
No, we all did it together.

00:17:52.430 --> 00:17:53.600
Shirabe...

00:17:54.160 --> 00:17:57.680
Well... the old woman I met in Matsushiro

00:17:57.680 --> 00:18:00.300
gave me all these summer vegetables...

00:18:00.560 --> 00:18:04.500
Tsukuyomi made it, 
and Tachibana will eat it.

00:18:04.500 --> 00:18:07.250
So I will do the cleaning.

00:18:07.250 --> 00:18:08.890
No, Senpai.

00:18:08.890 --> 00:18:11.250
If you proudly state you're going 
to do something you can't do,

00:18:11.250 --> 00:18:12.820
you'll regret it later.

00:18:13.700 --> 00:18:15.640
Don't underestimate me!

00:18:15.640 --> 00:18:17.220
No fighting.

00:18:17.220 --> 00:18:18.170
Here.

00:18:21.190 --> 00:18:22.640
What is this?

00:18:22.640 --> 00:18:24.380
Is this a tomato?

00:18:24.380 --> 00:18:26.750
I've never had one so sweet!

00:18:27.080 --> 00:18:30.090
So delicious you'll lose control!

00:19:08.040 --> 00:19:08.920
Here.

00:19:10.250 --> 00:19:13.610
Way to go, Miku. 
You always know just what I want.

00:19:15.320 --> 00:19:18.390
I wish Elfnein-chan could've come.

00:19:18.820 --> 00:19:22.600
Yeah. She said she still had 
something to look into.

00:19:22.600 --> 00:19:23.890
That's a shame.

00:19:23.890 --> 00:19:24.790
Yeah.

00:19:28.370 --> 00:19:30.550
Just hypothetically...

00:19:32.740 --> 00:19:37.320
If some bad guy was causing trouble 
for somebody somewhere...

00:19:37.320 --> 00:19:40.100
I could use my fists to deal with them.

00:19:41.810 --> 00:19:46.170
But a battle where both 
sides clench their fists

00:19:46.170 --> 00:19:48.790
because they believe what 
they're doing is right...

00:19:49.240 --> 00:19:51.830
can't be easily resolved.

00:19:53.090 --> 00:19:54.270
Hibiki...

00:19:55.040 --> 00:19:57.110
I've done it so far...

00:19:57.110 --> 00:20:02.750
but will I still be able to clench my 
fist believing in justice tomorrow?

00:20:03.790 --> 00:20:06.020
We don't know!

00:20:06.610 --> 00:20:07.770
Miku?

00:20:08.460 --> 00:20:09.710
But you know...

00:20:12.180 --> 00:20:15.170
Even if you can't believe in yourself,

00:20:15.170 --> 00:20:18.030
I won't let go of the hand I'm holding.

00:20:20.460 --> 00:20:24.460
I'll be holding it tight, 
no matter what happens.

00:20:32.280 --> 00:20:34.990
If you say that, Miku, then...

00:20:40.600 --> 00:20:43.060
Welcome home, Hibiki.

00:20:43.490 --> 00:20:45.800
I'm home, Miku!

00:20:46.580 --> 00:20:48.970
We're starting a card game!

00:20:49.410 --> 00:20:50.520
Okay!

00:22:30.730 --> 00:22:32.150
This is...

00:22:32.150 --> 00:22:33.310
I get it!

00:22:33.310 --> 00:22:34.940
That's why Hibiki-san...

00:22:35.300 --> 00:22:36.970
Did you figure something out?

00:22:37.490 --> 00:22:39.830
It's just a hypothesis, but...

00:22:39.830 --> 00:22:44.010
I figured out why Hibiki-san was able

00:22:44.010 --> 00:22:46.080
to be the vessel of divine power!

00:22:47.560 --> 00:22:50.540
It's said that the burden 
of original sin keeps

00:22:50.540 --> 00:22:54.170
mankind from being able to
 attain the power of the gods.

00:22:54.170 --> 00:22:58.270
And original sin is the Curse of Balal
 imprinted on humanity's souls.

00:23:00.470 --> 00:23:05.180
The light of the Shenshoujin burns away 
evil. Bathing in its light on that day

00:23:05.180 --> 00:23:07.600
broke Hibiki-san's curse.

00:23:08.360 --> 00:23:11.270
So she was cleansed of sin?

00:23:11.270 --> 00:23:18.820
That may explain her sudden change 
to being compatible, as well!

00:23:20.150 --> 00:23:21.540
Wait a second...

00:23:21.980 --> 00:23:25.280
It wasn't just Hibiki-kun

00:23:32.050 --> 00:23:35.450
who was bathed in the light 
of the Shenshoujin...

00:23:37.350 --> 00:23:39.970
<b>To Be Continued</b>
